  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add milk (for the mash) and 1/2 the butter and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6567b8bda66012fd8aa15e9a-8839116d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop brown onion. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and onion until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add cannellini beans and Italian herbs and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6567b8bda66012fd8aa15e9a-5a57829a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Stir cooking cream, the water and veg stock powder into bean mixture and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Season to taste.\n• Transfer bean filling to a baking dish and spread potato mash over the top.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6567b8bda66012fd8aa15e9a-2c94e99e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut tomato into wedges. In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide creamy white bean pie between plates. Serve with tomato salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6567b8bda66012fd8aa15e9a-d822c816.jpeg"
    }
  ]
